src/salmon_fish/_vendor/fish_speech/ contains an inference subset of the upstream
Fish Speech repository at commit 0f8a12e8a651062fdee9c33a894bdccd3a8513f1.
Modification: Python imports and Hydra target paths have been relocated from
fish_speech to salmon_fish._vendor.fish_speech to avoid package-name collisions.
Model layers, sampling algorithms, and codec operations are unchanged.

src/salmon_fish/ar.py adapts the upstream decode_one_token_ar orchestration to
expose intermediate snapshots. Sampling order, RNG draws, KV operations, and
returned frame layout are preserved. This adaptation retains the Fish Audio
Community License. Its observation API and tests are added by salmon-fish.

